# Vault & Secrets

- Preserve Fernet + PBKDF2 vault design unless Feature Plan + ADR say otherwise.
- Never log vault passwords, derived keys, or decrypted session payloads.
- Keep per-tenant vault state isolated.
- `.env` secrets and volume key material are production-critical — do not commit.
- See skill `vault-fernet-sessions` and agent `secrets-credential`.
